{"product_id":"drop-lampi-compact","title":"Drop Lampi Compact","description":"\u003cp\u003eLampi Compact represents the beloved purity of the Finnish nature and the serenity and aesthetics of Lapland in a smaller size. It is a beautiful haven of relaxation on your patio. The name Lampi is Finnish and refers to a pond. The still surface of the Lampi pool creates the perfect oasis for relaxing alone or in a larger group. The pool light perfects the mood on dark nights. The surface of the water ripples with sparkles as you unwind after your working day, under the midnight sun or lit by the Northern Lights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe electrically heated Drop spas are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"accordion tablinks active\" hidden=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"teknisettiedot\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 3-4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *190 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *171 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 900-1200 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 250 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"accordion tablinks active\" hidden=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eCONTENTS OF THE POOL PACKAGE\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"sisalto\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129511\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722535748,"sku":"301250509","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722568516,"sku":"301250508","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722601284,"sku":"301250209","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722634052,"sku":"301250208","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722666820,"sku":"301250409","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722699588,"sku":"301250408","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722732356,"sku":"301250559","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722765124,"sku":"301250558","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/files\/Drop_design-spa-rooftop-4-1-_309_368_670404e9-88c3-47e5-b1e9-02615f7bab0a.jpg?v=1704307422","url":"https:\/\/heatica.com\/en-ch\/products\/drop-lampi-compact","provider":"Heatica","version":"1.0","type":"link"}